cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "INDEX — Atlas mondial des ordres et registres d'architectes"
authors:
  - family-names: "Porporty"
    given-names: "Edberg"
    affiliation: "EDBERG.archi"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-06"
url: "https://index.archi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/edberg-archi/index"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - architects
  - professional regulation
  - registration bodies
  - "ordre des architectes"
  - "architects registration board"
  - atlas
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Sourced and dated headcounts of architects' official registration bodies
  (orders, chambers, boards, councils) for 180 countries, with registration
  regime, title protection, public registers, open-data catalogue and A-D
  data-quality grades. Every figure carries its primary source URL. Not a
  directory of persons: name lists stay with their publishers.
